# ── Defense-in-depth: any other secret-shaped files a contributor might create ──
# Catches Stripe / OpenAI / AWS / GCP / Twilio-style keys if they ever land here.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
credentials/

# SSL/TLS cert backups (keep active certs, ignore .bak/.bak2 files)
*.bak
*.bak2

